0. INTRODUCTION:
================

This package contains the USEFUL library, a collection of useful routines and
classes for compiler development and debugging.


1. DOCUMENTATION:
=================

The folder doc contains the documentation for LIBUSEFUL.


2. INSTALLATION:
================

2.1 Preprocessing after repository checkout:
--------------------------------------------

If you just have checked out this software distribution from its repository, run

  gmake -f Makefile.bootstrap

at first. This will run autoconf and automake in order to generate the build
environment. The LIBUSEFUL build environment is known to work with

  autoconf 2.59
  automake 1.8.4 and
  libtool 1.5.18


2.2 Configuration, build and installation:
------------------------------------------

Please refer to the procedures described in file INSTALL in the top-level
directory of this software distribution.
